    "output_token_ids_sha256": "c3bb29466bf1e891ccaf70b11c951c59cd127ad64e9ff7d8cf648a91441759f5",
    "raw_output": "```rust\nuse std::collections::BTreeMap;\n\npub fn patch_config(base: &[(&str, &str)], patches: &[(&str, &str, &str)]) -> Option<Vec<String>> {\n    if base.is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut result = Vec::new();\n    let mut base_map: BTreeMap<&str, String> = base.iter().map(|(k, v)| (*k, v.to_string())).collect();\n\n    for (op, key, value) in patches {\n        if key.is_empty() {\n            return None;\n        }\n\n        match op {\n            \"set\" => {\n                if base_map.contains_key(key) {\n                    base_map.remove(key);\n                }\n                base_map.insert(key, value.clone());\n            }\n            \"unset\" => {\n                if base_map.contains_key(key) {\n                    base_map.remove(key);\n                }\n            }\n            _ => return None,\n        }\n    }\n\n    let mut sorted: Vec<String> = base_map.into_iter().collect();\n    sorted.sort_by(|a, b| a.cmp(b));\n\n    Some(sorted)\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
